    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkīma Nshunemu kūshoka kaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makanza malebe ū Elisha walī walūngalūnga nū nkīma ū muna Shunemu, ūyo walī wajūūchiwa ng'witūnja wakwe; ūng'wīla, “Saamaga nī kaya yako ūje ūkikale ipandī līngī, nguno ū SEEBA wahayile īkūgwa nzala ū mu sī yenīyī ikanza lya myaka mpungatī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo wīta gīt'ūmo akawīlīlwa nū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu; ūsaama nī kaya yakwe būūkikala kū sī ya Bafilisiti kūshisha myaka mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta ī myaka mpungatī ūshoka ū kūfuma ū kū sī ya Bafilisiti, ūja ū kūlī ntemi kūjūlomba inhiwe ī numba yakwe na a malaale gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo ū ntemi ūsangwa alīhooya na Gehazi ū ntūmami o munhū o ng'wa Mulungu; ū ntemi ūbūūja, “Ūdūgije kūniwīla ī mihayo mitaale mitaale īyo wīyīta ū Elisha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandya ū Gehazi kūng'wīla ū ntemi ī mihayo ya ng'wa Elisha kūjūūcha mfu, kwimanīla wiza ū nkīma ūyo Elisha walī wanjūūcha ng'witūnja wakwe; wizaga ū kūlī ntemi kūlomba ashokejiwe ī numba yakwe na a malaale gakwe. Hūna ū Gehazi ūhaya, “Baba ntemi, nīyo ū nkīma ng'wene ūūyū. Nū nyanda ūyo akajūūchiwa na Elisha hū ng'wenūyū ūyū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūmūja chiza ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūmo īkajīla ī mihayo; nang'hwe ūnsomboolela.” Hūna ū ntemi ūnagīla ūmò wa batūmami bakwe angoloolele ī mihayo yakwe; ūng'wīla, “Nshokejage pyī ī shikolo shakwe, nī solobo īyo yigela kūfuma mu matwajo ga mu malaale gakwe, kwandīja aho wīngīla mu sī īyī kūshisha lelo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hazaeli kūmūlaga Beni-hadadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makanza malebe ū Elisha akaja Damasiko, ū Beni-hadadi ū ntemi wa Alamu ūsangwa nsaatu ī shikū jenījo. Ū ntemi aho wawīlwa gīkī, “Ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu wizaga kūnū,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūntūma Hazaeli ūng'wīla, “Solaga inong'ho ūje ūkibone nū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu; ūmūje ū SEEBA mu nzīla yakwe ūlū nakūpīla ū būsaatu wenūbū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hazaeli ūja ū kūmona ū Elisha, ūjana n'inong'ho, miligo makūmi anè ya shikolo shose ī shawiza, īsho shikabeejiagwa mu Damasiko; yūbūūchiwa ngamīla. Aho washika wīmīīla ū kū būtongi wakwe; ūng'wīla, “Ū ng'witūnja wako ū ntemi wa Alamu wanitūmaga nize nakūbūje gīkī, ‘A hene nakūpīla ū būsaatu wenūbū?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūng'wīla, “Jaga ūkang'wīle gīkī, ‘Ūkūpīla dūhū;’ alīyo hangī ū SEEBA wanoolekejaga gīkī akūcha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūnkalalīla no no no, kūshisha ū Hazaeli ūding'wa minala. Hūna ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu ūlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hazaeli ūbūūja, “Ni kinehe hangī ū baba būgonzo wayūlīla?” Ūshosha, “Nguno nagamanile a makoye ayo ūkūbīītīla a Baisilaeli, ī mizengo yabo īyo īzengeelilwe ndugu ūkwīpemba moto, a basūmba ba mu sī yabo ūkūbabūlaga na līlūshū, a beleele babo ūkūyūbataalīka hasī baacha, na a bakīma abo balī nda ūkūyūbatuumūla ī nda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hazaeli ūhaya, “Ū ntūmami wako ūyo alī sawa na mvwa dūhū, adūgije kinehe ū kwīta ī mihayo mitaale gītī yenīyo?” Ū Elisha ūhaya, “Ū SEEBA wanoolekejaga gīkī ū bebe ūkūbiza ntemi wa Alamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Hazaeli wīnga ū kūlī Elisha ūshoka kūlī ise būgonzo. Ū Beni-hadadi aho wamūja, “Ū Elisha wakūwīla kinehe?” Ū Hazaeli ūhaya, “Waniwīla gīkī ū kūpīla kwene ūkūpīla dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a ha ntondo yaho ūsola būlengeedi ūbūlobya mu minzī, hūna ūnkundīkīja ū ntemi ū kū nomo nī nindo ūpelwa myūyī ūcha. Hanuma ū Hazaeli wingīla wei a ha būtemi wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeholamu ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'waka gwa katanò go ng'wa Yolamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahabu aho alī ntemi wa Isilaeli, Yeholamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoshafati ūbiza ntemi wa Yuda; ū Yehoshafati ū ise walī ntemi wa Yuda ī shikū jenījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yeholamu aho alandya kūbiza ntemi walī na myaka makūmi adatū n'ībīlī; ūtema ikanza lya myaka īnaane alī mu Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Washimīzaga mu kūlondeela nzīla ja batemi ba Isilaeli; walondeelaga nhūngwa ja numba ya ng'wa Ahabu, nguno akantoola nshīke o ng'wa Ahabu; wīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA atīkenaagūlile ī Yuda kūlwa nguno ya ntūmami wakwe Daūdi, nguno walī wang'wisagīja ū Daūdi gīkī akūnekela tala kūlwa shibyalīlwe shakwe, yikale īkūbakaga shikū jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jakwe ū Yeholamu ī Edomu yūlema ū kūbiza ha sīlīlī ya būsugi wa Yuda, nayo yūtūūla ntemi wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūja Zaili na bashilikale bakwe, na magogoteni gakwe ga būlūgū; aho alī kwenūko a mabità ga Baedomu gūmpīndya hamò na a bashilikale bakwe; alīyo aho wila ū būjikū ūbūūka kūlwa nabo būlūgū. Gwike ūheewa, a banhū bakwe būpeela būshoka kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūshisha na lelo īyī ī Edomu yaalema ū kūbiza ha sīlīlī ya būsugi wa Yuda. Nī Libuna yūgoma a makanza genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Yeholamu, nī yīyo wīta, ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yeholamu wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa hamò nabo mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi. Ng'witūnja wakwe Ahazia wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahazia ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
