              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Būtooji:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Īī numba ya ntemi wa Yuda īkajūtoola ū kū ng'wa Ahabu; ū Ahazia wali ng'wizūkūlū o ng'wa Ahabu (Lola na 8:18).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
